          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "More Expressions and Their Terms"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.193,
            0.848,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 7:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Amu, Charan, Madhu, and John went to a hotel and ordered four dosas. Each dosa cost ₹23, and they wish to thank the waiter by tipping ₹5. Write an expression describing the total cost."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.383,
            0.255,
            0.616,
            0.273
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_8_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm { C o s t \\; o f \\; 4 \\; d o s a s } = 4 \\times 2 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.28,
            0.848,
            0.318
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can the total amount with tip be written as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\times 2 3 \\div 5 ?"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Evaluating it, we get"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.324,
            0.803,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.192,
                0.324,
                0.803,
                0.366
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_8_image_6.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.375,
            0.75,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\times 2 3 \\pm 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is a correct way of writing the expression."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.402,
            0.848,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? If the total number of friends goes up to 7 and the tip remains the same, how much will they have to pay? Write an expression for this situation and identify its terms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.469,
            0.848,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 8:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Children in a class are playing “Fire in the mountain, run, run, run!”. Whenever the teacher calls out a number, students are supposed to arrange themselves in groups of that number. Whoever is not part of the announced group size, is out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.551,
            0.362,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ruby wanted to rest and sat on one side. The other 33 students were playing the game in the class."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.661,
            0.359,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The teacher called out ‘5’. Once children settled, Ruby wrote"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.552,
            0.903,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.385,
